Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.19,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,600)\shad3\blur1\fs60\c&HF1F1F1&}Episode 5 \N {\fs100} Venus {ヴィーナスの巻}
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.00,Sign,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.28,0:00:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... My heart tingles!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.00,0:00:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could become that shell.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.33,0:00:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If I could, I would be a big clam. {????????? no clue what it has to do with a little brother, believing TSHS}{not "otouto" but "oo tou to" which I also have no idea what it could mean}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.23,0:00:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Venus's shell, Venus's shell,\Nshell, shell, shell, shell...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:57.98,0:01:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear. I've gotten itchy. {kayuku - joke so shitty I don't feel like adding a note for it}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.16,0:01:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, wake up, wake up!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.77,0:01:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.27,0:01:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Venus, you say? You mean that naked woman standing in the shell?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.09,0:01:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Friend, you sure have good taste.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:24.55,0:01:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If you go down this way, \Nyou should encounter her before long. {????????????? not a word; was "It's rather thick and tricky to navigate, though." in tshs}{罫 maybe, so if he goes on ahead in that direction, he'll find her idk man}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:31.48,0:01:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't think your legs'll take you there. \NYou should take a taxi.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:38.32,0:01:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Where to, Sir?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:40.04,0:01:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me to where the shellfish live.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:42.32,0:01:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Right away. {????}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:51.75,0:01:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,200 yen already?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:17.90,0:02:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the shell!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:24.99,0:02:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.19,0:02:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,, Oh, welcome. Would you like \Na little something to warm you up? {???????}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:30.83,0:02:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can give you a discount, hun. {????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.62,0:02:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, he's gone.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.32,0:02:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much \Nfor visiting our store.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.64,0:02:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to buy a gift, \Nbuild up your wealth, or go on a love hunt? {?}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.95,0:02:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.73,0:03:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps, if you were to place it \Non your lady's finger, like so?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.03,0:03:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Her heart would melt for you for sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.16,0:03:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Not buying?! {merely asking the price; just looking at goods; window-shopping; browsing}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.24,0:03:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The Venus?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.64,0:03:22.52,Song,,0,0,0,,Yonder, inside a comfortable shell... {????????????????????????? only reliably hear "kai de", I hear のっちょかんがった貝で but I get nothing when I look it up}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.76,0:03:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what's up?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.22,0:03:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I may be a shell of a man,\Nbut I'm a shell of a good admiral! {actually "navy general" but I like tshs's pun more}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.51,0:03:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, I was on the Battleship Yamato \N and oh, how we drank! {????}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.24,0:03:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Weird, this one won't open.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.23,0:03:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear, aren't you Alain Delon?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.30,0:03:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I just can't! My grandfather died from eating bad abalone, you see. {not sure how that joke works in a japanese, awabi isn't much like alan delon}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.08,0:03:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how cruel. {???????}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.58,0:04:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the sad fate of an Abalone.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.48,0:04:05.92,Song,,0,0,0,,My unrequited love... {? can't find what this song is, but at least the lyrics are audible: 叶わない恋と諦めましか}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.36,0:04:09.98,Song,,0,0,0,,Shall I give up on it?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.93,0:04:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Salty!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.96,0:05:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, this is incredible!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.82,0:05:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Venus! {KILL YOURSELF}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.51,0:05:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I have endured quite a struggle \Nto f-finally find you. {????}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.68,0:05:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you! I love you \Nfrom the bottom of my heart!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.60,0:05:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.83,0:05:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You're the only one \NI will ever love in this world! It's true!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.19,0:05:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My head was filled only with you. \NThat's how I found you! I love you. I love you!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.11,0:05:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you please answer my love?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.22,0:05:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how much \NI have struggled to find you. {??}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.57,0:06:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit... You don't understand me, do you? {? i actually hear "shiitto" lol}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.66,0:06:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, me—a man.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.39,0:06:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A man?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.60,0:06:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Woman.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.34,0:06:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Woman?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.25,0:06:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Wait...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.01,0:06:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't suppose you understand. \NThat word refers to the body, and...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.91,0:06:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.24,0:06:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're here again? {pussy so good he goes to Eden to get an apple of forbidden knowledge}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.40,0:06:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat this.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.55,0:06:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.92,0:06:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She'd probably understand \Nright away after eating this.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.51,0:06:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.43,0:07:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.72,0:07:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{?????}{think it's like a "bam!" or "bazinga!" kind of line}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.62,0:07:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.16,0:07:23.93,Overlap,,0,0,0,,You're gorgeous!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.82,0:07:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,One serving of takoyaki coming up! {no idea how this joke works}{they were so hot they cooked?}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.34,0:08:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the red corner, we have Black Tiger, \Nweighing in at a whopping 620 pounds! {???????}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.42,0:08:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.81,0:08:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Oh, no, oh, no! Oh, no, oh, no!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.63,0:08:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.59,0:08:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Follow me for a bit! {????}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.27,0:08:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,B-But I'm kinda b-busy here... {????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.08,0:08:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the black corner, we have a human playboy! \NWeighing in at 120 pounds! {??????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.43,0:09:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,3... 2... 1...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.01,0:09:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,0!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.70,0:09:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! I-It's a gold coin torpedo! {from the following lines gotta be koban = small oval gold coin used in the Edo period - no clue what's everything else and how doees that work ???}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.47,0:09:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All right... {??????}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.40,0:09:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Giving a gold coin to a cat! What a shock! {猫に小判}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.40,0:09:23.39,Note,,0,0,0,,[Japanese idiom]
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.72,0:09:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the Earth's surface\Nand live happily together.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.83,0:09:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}am{\i0} happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.61,0:09:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm very happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.11,0:09:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.33,0:10:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She became Venus the mummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.08,0:11:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,
